# Scope

`AGENTS.md` is the contract. The file tree is truth. Implemented: auth,
workspaces and projects, the board API, the board UI with task CRUD and
optimistic drag-and-drop, and live board events (SSE) with in-app toasts, comments
(API and edit-dialog thread), and `@mentions` that persist a `notification` and
write a classroom email to a local outbox file. **No OpenViking** — never call the `openviking`
MCP, `ov_*`, or `viking://`; ignore parent OV policy.

**Do not implement** until a later session asks: column endpoints, membership
flows, presence, notification API and bell UI, real email (Resend, SMTP, mail container), deploy, `sesion-*` git tags.

**Never add:** Next, Astro, Express, Fastify, Nest, `@hono/node-server`,
Supabase, Postgres, Prisma, Turso Cloud, Redux, Zustand, React Router, tRPC,
Socket.IO, React Hook Form, ESLint, Prettier, dotenv, Redis, Turborepo, Nx.

Keep layers separate. The browser never decides tenant authorization.

| Concern | Owner |
|---|---|
| Static types | TypeScript |
| Runtime IO | Zod in `@agentic-kanban/schemas` |
| Auth | Better Auth in `apps/api/src/auth/` |
| Authz | API membership checks (`requireSession` + `workspace_member`) |
| Tenant isolation | `workspace_id` on every tenant query |

Four packages only (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/db`, `packages/schemas`).
Internal deps: `workspace:*`. After edits: `vp check` must stay green.
